1
00:00:00,267 --> 00:00:02,327
Ah! I like where this is headed.

2
00:00:03,137 --> 00:00:06,797
"Your task is to rescue their leader
from a dungeon of ogres."

3
00:00:06,974 --> 00:00:08,734
(Sheldon:)That's a saucy twist.

4
00:00:09,176 --> 00:00:11,576
"That leader's name: Santa Claus."

5
00:00:11,745 --> 00:00:13,835
(Sheldon:)No, no, no.

6
00:00:14,515 --> 00:00:17,175
It's actually "ho, ho, ho,"
but you'll get the hang of it.

7
00:00:18,385 --> 00:00:20,645
(Leonard:)Thought it'd be fun to make
a holiday-themed quest.

8
00:00:20,821 --> 00:00:23,721
Fun? Mixing Dungeons & Dragons
with Christmas...

9
00:00:23,891 --> 00:00:27,331
(Sheldon:)...is like making a sandwich of grape jelly,
the best-tasting jelly...

10
00:00:27,494 --> 00:00:31,054
(Sheldon:)...and petroleum jelly,
the worst-tasting jelly.

11
00:00:32,233 --> 00:00:33,663
(Leonard:)Okay, here we go.

12
00:00:33,834 --> 00:00:36,894
"You find yourselves in the smoking
remains of Santa's village.

13
00:00:37,071 --> 00:00:39,271
Clearly a great battle has taken place."

14
00:00:39,473 --> 00:00:42,673
(Raj:)Oh, man, the first monster I see,
I'm going to sneak up behind him...

15
00:00:42,843 --> 00:00:46,973
(Raj:)...whip out my wand
and shoot my magic all over his ass.

16
00:00:49,483 --> 00:00:52,243
(Stuart:)Do you hear yourself
when you say these things?

17
00:00:53,887 --> 00:00:57,377
(Leonard:)Okay, there are ogre tracks and
a trail of broken candy canes in the snow.

18
00:00:57,558 --> 00:00:58,688
(Leonard:)Sheldon, what do you do?

19
00:00:58,859 --> 00:01:03,519
(Sheldon:)I signal my contempt for your cruel plan
to shove Christmas joy down my throat...

